<div class="checkout-layout"><section class="checkout-card"><h4 class="fw-800 mb-1">Mode de réception</h4><p class="text-muted small mb-3">Retrait gratuit ou livraison selon votre zone.</p><form method="post" action="<?=e(base_url('checkout'))?>"><?=csrf_field()?><div class="fulfillment-choice mb-3"><label><input type="radio" name="fulfillment" value="RETRAIT" checked>↻ Retrait en magasin<div class="small text-muted fw-normal mt-1">Vous récupérez la commande chez KIN-MART.</div></label><label><input type="radio" name="fulfillment" value="LIVRAISON">🚚 Livraison<div class="small text-muted fw-normal mt-1">Frais selon la zone sélectionnée.</div></label></div><div id="deliveryFields"><div class="p-3 rounded-4 bg-light mb-3"><div class="small fw-bold mb-2">Adresse de livraison</div><div class="row g-2"><div class="col-12"><select class="form-select" name="delivery_zone_id"><option value="">Sélectionner une zone…</option><?php foreach($zones as $z):?><option value="<?=$z['id']?>"><?=e($z['name'])?> — <?=money($z['fee_usd'])?></option><?php endforeach;?></select></div><div class="col-md-6"><input class="form-control" name="commune" placeholder="Commune"></div><div class="col-md-6"><input class="form-control" name="quartier" placeholder="Quartier"></div><div class="col-md-8"><input class="form-control" name="avenue" placeholder="Avenue"></div><div class="col-md-4"><input class="form-control" name="number" placeholder="N°"></div><div class="col-12"><input class="form-control" name="reference_text" placeholder="Point de repère / référence"></div><div class="col-md-6"><input class="form-control" name="phone" placeholder="Téléphone"></div><div class="col-12"><textarea class="form-control" rows="3" name="instructions" placeholder="Instructions pour le livreur (facultatif)"></textarea></div></div></div></div><div class="mt-3"><label class="form-label">Code promotionnel</label><div class="input-group"><input class="form-control" name="coupon_code" placeholder="Ex. KINMART10"><span class="input-group-text bg-white">%</span></div></div><div class="alert alert-light border rounded-4 mt-3 mb-0 small">🔒 Votre commande est enregistrée dans KIN-MART. Les modalités de paiement peuvent être confirmées selon le processus du magasin.</div><button class="btn btn-km btn-lg w-100 mt-3">Confirmer ma commande →</button></form></section><aside class="km-card checkout-summary"><div class="small-caps">Votre panier</div><?php foreach($items as $p):?><div class="d-flex gap-3 py-3 border-bottom"><img src="<?=e(product_image_url($p))?>" style="width:54px;height:54px;object-fit:cover;border-radius:12px" alt=""><div class="flex-grow-1"><strong class="small d-block"><?=e($p['name'])?></strong><span class="small text-muted">Qté <?=e($p['cart_qty'])?></span></div><strong class="small"><?=money($p['line_total'])?></strong></div><?php endforeach;?><div class="summary-line mt-2"><span>Sous-total</span><strong><?=money($total)?></strong></div><div class="summary-line"><span>Livraison</span><span class="text-muted">Selon la zone</span></div><div class="summary-total"><span>Total provisoire</span><span><?=money($total)?></span></div><div class="small text-muted">Le montant final inclura les éventuels frais de livraison et réductions applicables.</div></aside></div>
<script>document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded',()=>{const radios=[...document.querySelectorAll('input[name="fulfillment"]')],d=document.getElementById('deliveryFields');function u(){const v=document.querySelector('input[name="fulfillment"]:checked')?.value;d.style.display=v==='LIVRAISON'?'block':'none'}radios.forEach(r=>r.addEventListener('change',u));u()})</script>
